WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.528
Check claims by comparing credible sources before sharing

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:08.989
Information: facts or knowledge that help us understand something. Interview:

00:00:08.989 --> 00:00:11.300
learning by asking someone questions.

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:16.697
Book: a printed or digital source of organised knowledge. Verification: checking

00:00:16.697 --> 00:00:21.693
whether information is supported by evidence. Reliable source: a source that is

00:00:21.693 --> 00:00:24.191
accurate and suitable for a question.

00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:29.705
Ask two trusted sources the same factual question and compare their answers.
